<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 0%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 97.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -97.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 97.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -97.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">: 전역후 5년이내 예비군</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 89.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -89.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">기&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> : 2011. 4. 11.～ 9. 30.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 105.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -105.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">당첨발표 : 병무청홈페이지 공지사항 게시(2011년 7월 및 10월 둘째 주)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 89.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -89.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">추첨 방식</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"> : 전산추첨(랜덤방식)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 89.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -89.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">상품 내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;▸ 금상 : 50만원상당 아이팟(터치) 1명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;▸ 은상 : 5만원 상당 문화상품권 10명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;▸ 동상 : 3만원 상당 문화상품권 100명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 89.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -89.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 본 이벤트는 1회에 한하여 참여하실 수 있습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ 본 행사에서 수집되는 응모자의 정보는 “공공기관의 개인정보 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">보호에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\">관한 법률”에 의하여 철저히 보호되며, 병력동원(훈련)소집통지서와</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.7pt\">예비군</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\"> 관련 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">보</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">제공에만 사용됨을 알려 드립니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">&nbsp;❍ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">기타 자세한 내용은 대구경북지방병무청 동원관리과(053-607-6317</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">)로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 63.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -63.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><a href=\"http://www.mma.go.kr/kor/n_news/notice/1239899_4096.html\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">참여하기</span>\n</a></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 63.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -63.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><a href=\"http://www.mma.go.kr/kor/n_news/notice/1239899_4096.html\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\">▼ (Click)</span></a></p><a href=\"http://www.mma.go.kr/kor/n_news/notice/1239899_4096.h